  (rectangle
    (start 12.7 20.32)
    (end 106.68 96.52)
    (stroke (width 0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "bae739e3-0a40-4b87-b9e8-158266ae6853")
  )
  (text "USB-C input"
    (at 13.97 24.13 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "95244333-0820-4a78-a06e-ea92effc2305")
  )
  (text "5.1k on CC1/CC2 asks any USB-C charger\nfor 5 V. D+/D- go to the header."
    (at 13.97 91.19 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "732e4a52-da0f-4425-8f44-24d2ac07b773")
  )
  (rectangle
    (start 110.49 20.32)
    (end 208.28 96.52)
    (stroke (width 0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "7a8b75d1-d500-4a36-8ec2-a17a8381e872")
  )
  (text "Charger - TI BQ25173"
    (at 111.76 24.13 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "11bbb44e-d887-4495-9a60-6acd494b5d16")
  )
  (text "300 mA constant current, then constant voltage.\nVREG = 0.8 V x (1 + R4/R5): LIC 3.71 V (R4 120k) / EDLC 2.62 V (R4 75k).\nR5 returns to /PG: no divider drain while USB is unplugged."
    (at 111.76 26.67 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "427dfcdb-3312-4d7f-adc8-e85ff4a91248")
  )
  (rectangle
    (start 212.09 20.32)
    (end 298.45 96.52)
    (stroke (width 0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "8add222c-268f-4268-a5aa-c637217f3fcd")
  )
  (text "Capacitor + master switch"
    (at 213.36 24.13 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "cb0383db-bc49-46ea-aea1-242a252d2b30")
  )
  (text "Q1 connects the capacitor to everything else.\nUSB (Q2) turns it on; the supervisor (Q3) keeps\nit on. Below the cut-off Q1 opens and stays open\nuntil USB returns."
    (at 213.36 87.13 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "9b045fa6-2031-4e53-9e22-1033d1527715")
  )
  (rectangle
    (start 302.26 20.32)
    (end 406.4 96.52)
    (stroke (width 0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "876b1dbe-b5e2-4650-89cb-3f6a523c728f")
  )
  (text "Cut-off + ship mode - TPS3808"
    (at 303.53 24.13 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "d1c0aedb-c2bd-4047-8778-f2fddcac29e4")
  )
  (text "Cut-off = 0.405 V x (1 + 1.8M / R13)\nLIC 2.61 V (R13 330k) / EDLC 1.96 V (470k).\nSHIP high pulls /MR low: Q1 opens and the\ncapacitor sees only leakage."
    (at 359.41 80.01 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "889c1230-9f6f-4abc-b20d-1c6947c612c1")
  )
  (rectangle
    (start 12.7 100.33)
    (end 208.28 186.69)
    (stroke (width 0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "1747d330-5efc-4e49-b52f-4cf5908c4a33")
  )
  (text "Power switch + wake logic"
    (at 13.97 104.14 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "84c9b826-99b0-4ec3-92d5-2c2e9b8bedf7")
  )
  (text "Q5 feeds VSYS while EN_SYS is high. EN_SYS is raised by the button, the RTC\nalarm, USB (JP1, default on), HOLD from firmware, or JP2 (always on). C8 holds\nit ~2 s after a press so firmware can raise HOLD; HOLD low = off in 0.2 s.\nQ8 (gated by the supervisor) sits under Q6: below the cut-off nothing turns it on."
    (at 13.97 177.3 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "01e2a007-b3a0-4986-b035-9f8b1c516ead")
  )
  (rectangle
    (start 212.09 100.33)
    (end 406.4 186.69)
    (stroke (width 0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "b3bf7fad-477d-44bd-b4ac-803c69db7eda")
  )
  (text "3.3 V buck-boost - TI TPS63031"
    (at 213.36 104.14 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "719674be-f3e1-4c93-9252-6dab230746ad")
  )
  (text "1.8-5.5 V in, 3.3 V out, ~500 mA from a 2.6 V capacitor.\nVSENSE = VSYS / 2 for your ADC; draws current only while on."
    (at 213.36 181.36 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "b118eb4d-30ea-47b2-a600-5fd6947a6989")
  )
  (rectangle
    (start 12.7 190.5)
    (end 120.65 250.19)
    (stroke (width 0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid "08cdec93-6a84-4800-b6c6-3db7ef77ffe8")
  )
  (text "Real-time clock - NXP PCF8563"
    (at 13.97 194.31 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "ba9de086-e697-4e22-8188-e715ad4e7970")
  )
  (text "Runs from VAON. Its alarm pulls WAKE_N low to start\nthe gadget. I2C address 0x51."
    (at 13.97 244.86 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "6fd4e056-ce90-495f-b3bf-a1e3ac65b842")
  )
  (rectangle
    (start 124.46 190.5)
    (end 233.68 250.19)
